"use strict";(self.webpackChunkrunn2011blog=self.webpackChunkrunn2011blog||[]).push([[5873],{628:(s,a)=>{a.A=(s,a)=>{const n=s.__vccOpts||s;for(const[s,p]of a)n[s]=p;return n}},2451:(s,a,n)=>{n.r(a),n.d(a,{comp:()=>l,data:()=>m});var p=n(8178);const t={},l=(0,n(628).A)(t,[["render",function(s,a){return(0,p.uX)(),(0,p.CE)("div",null,a[0]||(a[0]=[(0,p.Fv)('<h1 id="计算机处理微分方程和数值模拟" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#计算机处理微分方程和数值模拟"><span>计算机处理微分方程和数值模拟</span></a></h1><h2 id="什么是pde-solver" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#什么是pde-solver"><span>什么是pde solver</span></a></h2><p><strong>PDE solver</strong> 就是“偏微分方程求解器”。</p><p>PDE = <strong>Partial Differential Equation，偏微分方程</strong>。它描述的是某个量在<strong>空间和时间上如何变化</strong>，比如温度、速度、压力、电场、水流高度等。</p><p>所以 <strong>PDE solver</strong> 可以理解成：</p><blockquote><p>用数值方法在计算机上近似求解偏微分方程的程序/算法。</p></blockquote><p>比如这些问题都常用 PDE 描述：</p><p><strong>热传导：</strong><br> 一块铁板受热后，热量怎么扩散？</p><p><strong>流体运动：</strong><br> 水流、空气、烟雾、湍流怎么运动？</p><p><strong>电磁场：</strong><br> 电磁波如何传播？</p><p><strong>弹性力学：</strong><br> 桥梁、汽车零件受力后怎么变形？</p><p><strong>图像处理：</strong><br> 图像去噪、边缘扩散也可以用 PDE 模型。</p><hr><p>一个简单例子：热传导方程</p><p>假设一根金属棒，温度随时间变化：</p><p class="katex-block"><span class="katex-display"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="block"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">∂</mi><mi>u</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">∂</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>α</mi><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant="normal">∂</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>u</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">∂</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\\frac{\\partial u}{\\partial t} = \\alpha \\frac{\\partial^2 u}{\\partial x^2} </annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:2.0574em;vertical-align:-0.686em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mopen nulldelimiter"></span><span class="mfrac"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:1.3714em;"><span style="top:-2.314em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:3em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord" style="margin-right:0.05556em;">∂</span><span class="mord mathnormal">t</span></span></span><span style="top:-3.23em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:3em;"></span><span class="frac-line" style="border-bottom-width:0.04em;"></span></span><span style="top:-3.677em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:3em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord" style="margin-right:0.05556em;">∂</span><span class="mord mathnormal">u</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.686em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mclose nulldelimiter"></span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">=</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:2.1771em;vertical-align:-0.686em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right:0.0037em;">α</span><span class="mord"><span class="mopen nulldelimiter"></span><span class="mfrac"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:1.4911em;"><span style="top:-2.314em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:3em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord" style="margin-right:0.05556em;">∂</span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal">x</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.7401em;"><span style="top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style="top:-3.23em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:3em;"></span><span class="frac-line" style="border-bottom-width:0.04em;"></span></span><span style="top:-3.677em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:3em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord"><span class="mord" style="margin-right:0.05556em;">∂</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.8141em;"><span style="top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mord mathnormal">u</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.686em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mclose nulldelimiter"></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p>这里：</p><ul><li>(u)：温度</li><li>(t)：时间</li><li>(x)：位置</li><li>(\\alpha)：热扩散系数</li></ul><p>这个方程的意思大概是：</p><blockquote><p>温度会从高温区域向低温区域扩散，扩散速度和空间上的温度弯曲程度有关。</p></blockquote><p>但真实问题里通常很难手算，所以就把空间切成很多小格子，把时间切成很多小步，然后让计算机一步步算。这类程序就是 <strong>PDE solver</strong>。</p><hr><p>常见 PDE solver 方法有：</p><table><thead><tr><th>方法</th><th>直观理解</th><th>常见用途</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>有限差分法 FDM</td><td>把连续空间切成网格，用差分近似导数</td><td>简单热传导、波动方程</td></tr><tr><td>有限元法 FEM</td><td>把区域切成小三角形/小单元</td><td>结构力学、工程仿真</td></tr><tr><td>有限体积法 FVM</td><td>关注每个小体积里的守恒量</td><td>流体力学、CFD</td></tr><tr><td>谱方法</td><td>用正弦、余弦等基函数逼近解</td><td>高精度科学计算</td></tr><tr><td>PINN</td><td>用神经网络拟合 PDE 的解</td><td>AI 科学计算</td></tr></tbody></table><hr><p>如果你之前问的是“水流流向浴盆下水口”那类模拟，里面就可能涉及 <strong>流体 PDE solver</strong>，比如求解：</p><ul><li>Navier-Stokes 方程，描述粘性流体运动</li><li>Shallow Water Equations，描述浅水表面流动</li><li>粒子法 SPH，虽然不一定直接在网格上解 PDE，但背后也和流体方程有关</li></ul><p>一句话总结：</p><blockquote><p><strong>PDE solver 就是把物理世界里的连续变化规律，转化成计算机可以一步步算出来的数值模拟工具。</strong></p></blockquote><blockquote><p>用数值方法在计算机上近似求解偏微分方程的程序/算法。<br> 从底层讲解：为什么要近似，为什么不能直接求解，为什么计算机适合数值模拟</p></blockquote><p>从底层看，PDE solver 的核心问题是：</p><blockquote><p>现实中的物理规律通常是“连续”的，但计算机只能处理“有限、离散、可存储、可计算”的东西。<br> 所以我们必须把连续问题近似成离散问题。</p></blockquote><hr><h2 id="_1-pde-描述的是-连续世界" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#_1-pde-描述的是-连续世界"><span>1. PDE 描述的是“连续世界”</span></a></h2><p>比如一根金属棒上的温度：</p><p class="katex-block"><span class="katex-display"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="block"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator="true">,</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">u(x,t) </annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal">u</span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord mathnormal">x</span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal">t</span><span class="mclose">)</span></span></span></span></span></p><p>它表示：在位置 (x)、时间 (t) 处的温度。</p><p>这里有两个关键点：</p><p>第一，位置 (x) 是连续的。<br> 金属棒上不是只有 10 个点，也不是 100 万个点，而是理论上有无穷多个点。</p><p>第二，时间 (t) 也是连续的。<br> 从 (t=0) 到 (t=1) 秒之间，不只是 0.1、0.2、0.3 秒，而是有无穷多个时刻。</p><p>所以 PDE 想求的不是一个数字，而是一个<strong>函数</strong>：</p><p class="katex-block"><span class="katex-display"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="block"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator="true">,</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">u(x,t) </annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal">u</span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord mathnormal">x</span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal">t</span><span class="mclose">)</span></span></span></span></span></p><p>也就是说，它要告诉你：</p><blockquote><p>每一个空间位置、每一个时间瞬间，温度分别是多少。</p></blockquote><p>这本质上是一个无限维问题。</p><hr><h2 id="_2-为什么不能-直接求解" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#_2-为什么不能-直接求解"><span>2. 为什么不能“直接求解”？</span></a></h2><p>这里的“直接求解”通常指：找到一个精确公式，比如：</p><p class="katex-block"><span class="katex-display"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="block"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator="true">,</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mtext>某个显式表达式</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">u(x,t)=某个显式表达式 </annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal">u</span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord mathnormal">x</span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal">t</span><span class="mclose">)</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">=</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.6833em;"></span><span class="mord cjk_fallback">某个显式表达式</span></span></span></span></span></p><p>就像中学里解方程：</p><p class="katex-block"><span class="katex-display"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="block"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">x^2-4=0 </annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.9474em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal">x</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.8641em;"><span style="top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2222em;"></span><span class="mbin">−</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2222em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.6444em;"></span><span class="mord">4</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">=</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.6444em;"></span><span class="mord">0</span></span></span></span></span></p><p>可以直接得到：</p><p class="katex-block"><span class="katex-display"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="block"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mspace width="1em"></mspace><mtext>或</mtext><mspace width="1em"></mspace><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">x=2 \\quad 或 \\quad x=-2 </annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.4306em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal">x</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">=</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.6833em;"></span><span class="mord">2</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:1em;"></span><span class="mord cjk_fallback">或</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:1em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal">x</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">=</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;"></span><span class="mord">−</span><span class="mord">2</span></span></span></span></span></p><p>但 PDE 通常没有这么简单。</p><p>原因主要有三个。</p><hr><h2 id="_3-原因一-未知量太多-是无穷多个" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#_3-原因一-未知量太多-是无穷多个"><span>3. 原因一：未知量太多，是无穷多个</span></a></h2><p>普通代数方程：</p><p class="katex-block"><span class="katex-display"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="block"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">x+1=3 </annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal">x</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2222em;"></span><span class="mbin">+</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2222em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.6444em;"></span><span class="mord">1</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">=</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.6444em;"></span><span class="mord">3</span></span></span></span></span></p><p>未知量是一个数 (x)。</p><p>线性方程组：</p><p class="katex-block"><span class="katex-display"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="block"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">Ax=b </annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.6833em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal">A</span><span class="mord mathnormal">x</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">=</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.6944em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal">b</span></span></span></span></span></p><p>未知量是一组有限的数，比如 (x_1,x_2,\\dots,x_n)。</p><p>但 PDE 的未知量是函数：</p><p class="katex-block"><span class="katex-display"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="block"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator="true">,</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">u(x,t) </annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal">u</span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord mathnormal">x</span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal">t</span><span class="mclose">)</span></span></span></span></span></p><p>函数的本质是：给每个 (x,t) 都分配一个值。</p><p>如果空间和时间是连续的，那么点的数量是无限的。<br> 这就相当于你要同时解无穷多个未知量。</p><p>计算机内存里不能存储“所有连续点上的值”。<br> 它只能存储有限个数字。</p><p>所以我们必须选一些点来代表整体：</p><p class="katex-block"><span class="katex-display"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="block"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo separator="true">,</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator="true">,</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo separator="true">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator="true">,</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>N</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">x_0,x_1,x_2,\\dots,x_N </annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal">x</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.3011em;"><span style="top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight">0</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal">x</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.3011em;"><span style="top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight">1</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal">x</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.3011em;"><span style="top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight">2</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.1667em;"></span><span class="minner">…</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.1667em;"></span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal">x</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.3283em;"><span style="top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right:0.10903em;">N</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p>以及一些时刻：</p><p class="katex-block"><span class="katex-display"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="block"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo separator="true">,</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator="true">,</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo separator="true">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator="true">,</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>M</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t_0,t_1,t_2,\\dots,t_M </annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.8095em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal">t</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.3011em;"><span style="top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight">0</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal">t</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.3011em;"><span style="top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight">1</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal">t</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.3011em;"><span style="top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight">2</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.1667em;"></span><span class="minner">…</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.1667em;"></span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal">t</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.3283em;"><span style="top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right:0.10903em;">M</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p>然后只计算这些格点上的近似值：</p><p class="katex-block"><span class="katex-display"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="block"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>u</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></msubsup><mo>≈</mo><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo separator="true">,</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">u_i^n \\approx u(x_i,t_n) </annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.9614em;vertical-align:-0.247em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal">u</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.7144em;"><span style="top:-2.453em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">i</span></span></span><span style="top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">n</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.247em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">≈</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal">u</span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal">x</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.3117em;"><span style="top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">i</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal">t</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.1514em;"><span style="top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">n</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mclose">)</span></span></span></span></span></p><p>这就是离散化。</p><hr><h2 id="_4-原因二-很多-pde-没有解析解" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#_4-原因二-很多-pde-没有解析解"><span>4. 原因二：很多 PDE 没有解析解</span></a></h2><p>有些简单 PDE 可以精确求解。</p><p>比如理想条件下的一维热方程、波动方程，有时可以用傅里叶级数写出解析解。</p><p>但真实问题通常会有：</p><ul><li>复杂几何形状，比如飞机机翼、人体血管、城市地形</li><li>复杂边界条件，比如某些地方绝热、某些地方固定温度、某些地方有流入流出</li><li>非线性，比如流体速度本身又影响流体变化</li><li>多物理耦合，比如热、力、电磁、化学反应同时存在</li><li>材料参数不均匀，比如某些地方导热快，某些地方导热慢</li></ul><p>这些因素会让 PDE 很难甚至不可能写成一个漂亮的显式公式。</p><p>比如 Navier-Stokes 方程描述流体运动。它的形式大概是：</p><p class="katex-block"><span class="katex-display"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="block"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">∂</mi><mi mathvariant="bold">u</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">∂</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi mathvariant="bold">u</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">∇</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mi mathvariant="bold">u</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>ρ</mi></mfrac><mi mathvariant="normal">∇</mi><mi>p</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>ν</mi><msup><mi mathvariant="normal">∇</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant="bold">u</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\\frac{\\partial \\mathbf{u}}{\\partial t} + (\\mathbf{u}\\cdot\\nabla)\\mathbf{u} = -\\frac{1}{\\rho}\\nabla p + \\nu \\nabla^2 \\mathbf{u} </annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:2.0574em;vertical-align:-0.686em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mopen nulldelimiter"></span><span class="mfrac"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:1.3714em;"><span style="top:-2.314em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:3em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord" style="margin-right:0.05556em;">∂</span><span class="mord mathnormal">t</span></span></span><span style="top:-3.23em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:3em;"></span><span class="frac-line" style="border-bottom-width:0.04em;"></span></span><span style="top:-3.677em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:3em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord" style="margin-right:0.05556em;">∂</span><span class="mord mathbf">u</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.686em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mclose nulldelimiter"></span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2222em;"></span><span class="mbin">+</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2222em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;"></span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord mathbf">u</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2222em;"></span><span class="mbin">⋅</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2222em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;"></span><span class="mord">∇</span><span class="mclose">)</span><span class="mord mathbf">u</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">=</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:2.2019em;vertical-align:-0.8804em;"></span><span class="mord">−</span><span class="mord"><span class="mopen nulldelimiter"></span><span class="mfrac"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:1.3214em;"><span style="top:-2.314em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:3em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal">ρ</span></span></span><span style="top:-3.23em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:3em;"></span><span class="frac-line" style="border-bottom-width:0.04em;"></span></span><span style="top:-3.677em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:3em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord">1</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.8804em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mclose nulldelimiter"></span></span><span class="mord">∇</span><span class="mord mathnormal">p</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2222em;"></span><span class="mbin">+</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2222em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.8641em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right:0.06366em;">ν</span><span class="mord"><span class="mord">∇</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.8641em;"><span style="top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mord mathbf">u</span></span></span></span></span></p><p>这里最麻烦的是：</p><p class="katex-block"><span class="katex-display"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="block"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi mathvariant="bold">u</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">∇</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mi mathvariant="bold">u</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(\\mathbf{u}\\cdot\\nabla)\\mathbf{u} </annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;"></span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord mathbf">u</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2222em;"></span><span class="mbin">⋅</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2222em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;"></span><span class="mord">∇</span><span class="mclose">)</span><span class="mord mathbf">u</span></span></span></span></span></p><p>这是非线性项。<br> 它表示“流体速度会搬运流体速度自己”。</p><p>直观地说：</p><blockquote><p>水的运动方向，会影响水接下来怎么运动；而接下来的运动又反过来改变速度场。</p></blockquote><p>这种自我耦合让方程很难直接解。</p><hr><h2 id="_5-原因三-真实边界太复杂" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#_5-原因三-真实边界太复杂"><span>5. 原因三：真实边界太复杂</span></a></h2><p>解析解通常需要很理想的条件，比如：</p><ul><li>区域是直线、矩形、圆形、球形</li><li>边界条件非常规则</li><li>参数是常数</li><li>初始状态有简单表达式</li></ul><p>但真实问题不是这样。</p><p>比如模拟一个浴盆里的水流向下水口。<br> 区域可能有弯曲边界，水面会变化，下水口附近速度很大，还可能有旋涡、湍动、空气混入。</p><p>你很难写出一个公式说：</p><p class="katex-block"><span class="katex-display"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="block"><semantics><mrow><mtext>水面高度</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>某个简单函数</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">水面高度 = 某个简单函数 </annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.6833em;"></span><span class="mord cjk_fallback">水面高度</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">=</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.6833em;"></span><span class="mord cjk_fallback">某个简单函数</span></span></span></span></span></p><p>所以实际工程里通常不追求“精确公式”，而是追求：</p><blockquote><p>在给定误差范围内，算出足够可信的近似结果。</p></blockquote><hr><h2 id="_6-计算机为什么适合数值模拟" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#_6-计算机为什么适合数值模拟"><span>6. 计算机为什么适合数值模拟？</span></a></h2><p>因为计算机非常擅长三件事：</p><ol><li>存储大量数字</li><li>重复执行简单运算</li><li>按步骤推进状态</li></ol><p>而数值 PDE solver 正好可以把问题变成这三件事。</p><hr><h2 id="_7-连续问题如何变成计算机问题" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#_7-连续问题如何变成计算机问题"><span>7. 连续问题如何变成计算机问题？</span></a></h2><p>以热传导方程为例：</p><p class="katex-block"><span class="katex-display"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="block"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">∂</mi><mi>u</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">∂</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>α</mi><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant="normal">∂</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>u</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">∂</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\\frac{\\partial u}{\\partial t} = \\alpha \\frac{\\partial^2 u}{\\partial x^2} </annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:2.0574em;vertical-align:-0.686em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mopen nulldelimiter"></span><span class="mfrac"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:1.3714em;"><span style="top:-2.314em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:3em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord" style="margin-right:0.05556em;">∂</span><span class="mord mathnormal">t</span></span></span><span style="top:-3.23em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:3em;"></span><span class="frac-line" style="border-bottom-width:0.04em;"></span></span><span style="top:-3.677em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:3em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord" style="margin-right:0.05556em;">∂</span><span class="mord mathnormal">u</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.686em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mclose nulldelimiter"></span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">=</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:2.1771em;vertical-align:-0.686em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right:0.0037em;">α</span><span class="mord"><span class="mopen nulldelimiter"></span><span class="mfrac"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:1.4911em;"><span style="top:-2.314em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:3em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord" style="margin-right:0.05556em;">∂</span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal">x</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.7401em;"><span style="top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style="top:-3.23em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:3em;"></span><span class="frac-line" style="border-bottom-width:0.04em;"></span></span><span style="top:-3.677em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:3em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord"><span class="mord" style="margin-right:0.05556em;">∂</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.8141em;"><span style="top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mord mathnormal">u</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.686em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mclose nulldelimiter"></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p>它包含导数。</p><p>导数的本质是“极限”：</p><p class="katex-block"><span class="katex-display"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="block"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">∂</mi><mi>u</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">∂</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><munder><mrow><mi>lim</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>→</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator="true">,</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator="true">,</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\\frac{\\partial u}{\\partial t} = \\lim_{\\Delta t\\to 0} \\frac{u(x,t+\\Delta t)-u(x,t)}{\\Delta t} </annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:2.0574em;vertical-align:-0.686em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mopen nulldelimiter"></span><span class="mfrac"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:1.3714em;"><span style="top:-2.314em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:3em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord" style="margin-right:0.05556em;">∂</span><span class="mord mathnormal">t</span></span></span><span style="top:-3.23em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:3em;"></span><span class="frac-line" style="border-bottom-width:0.04em;"></span></span><span style="top:-3.677em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:3em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord" style="margin-right:0.05556em;">∂</span><span class="mord mathnormal">u</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.686em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mclose nulldelimiter"></span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">=</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:2.1713em;vertical-align:-0.7443em;"></span><span class="mop op-limits"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.6944em;"><span style="top:-2.3557em;margin-left:0em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:3em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight"><span class="mord mtight">Δ</span><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">t</span><span class="mrel mtight">→</span><span class="mord mtight">0</span></span></span></span><span style="top:-3em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:3em;"></span><span><span class="mop">lim</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.7443em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mopen nulldelimiter"></span><span class="mfrac"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:1.427em;"><span style="top:-2.314em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:3em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord">Δ</span><span class="mord mathnormal">t</span></span></span><span style="top:-3.23em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:3em;"></span><span class="frac-line" style="border-bottom-width:0.04em;"></span></span><span style="top:-3.677em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:3em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal">u</span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord mathnormal">x</span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal">t</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2222em;"></span><span class="mbin">+</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2222em;"></span><span class="mord">Δ</span><span class="mord mathnormal">t</span><span class="mclose">)</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2222em;"></span><span class="mbin">−</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2222em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal">u</span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord mathnormal">x</span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal">t</span><span class="mclose">)</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.686em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mclose nulldelimiter"></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p>但计算机不能真的让 (\\Delta t) 变成无限小。<br> 所以我们选一个很小但有限的时间步长：</p><p class="katex-block"><span class="katex-display"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="block"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\\Delta t </annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.6833em;"></span><span class="mord">Δ</span><span class="mord mathnormal">t</span></span></span></span></span></p><p>然后近似：</p><p class="katex-block"><span class="katex-display"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="block"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">∂</mi><mi>u</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">∂</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>≈</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator="true">,</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator="true">,</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\\frac{\\partial u}{\\partial t} \\approx \\frac{u(x,t+\\Delta t)-u(x,t)}{\\Delta t} </annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:2.0574em;vertical-align:-0.686em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mopen nulldelimiter"></span><span class="mfrac"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:1.3714em;"><span style="top:-2.314em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:3em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord" style="margin-right:0.05556em;">∂</span><span class="mord mathnormal">t</span></span></span><span style="top:-3.23em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:3em;"></span><span class="frac-line" style="border-bottom-width:0.04em;"></span></span><span style="top:-3.677em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:3em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord" style="margin-right:0.05556em;">∂</span><span class="mord mathnormal">u</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.686em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mclose nulldelimiter"></span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">≈</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:2.113em;vertical-align:-0.686em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mopen nulldelimiter"></span><span class="mfrac"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:1.427em;"><span style="top:-2.314em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:3em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord">Δ</span><span class="mord mathnormal">t</span></span></span><span style="top:-3.23em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:3em;"></span><span class="frac-line" style="border-bottom-width:0.04em;"></span></span><span style="top:-3.677em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:3em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal">u</span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord mathnormal">x</span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal">t</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2222em;"></span><span class="mbin">+</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2222em;"></span><span class="mord">Δ</span><span class="mord mathnormal">t</span><span class="mclose">)</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2222em;"></span><span class="mbin">−</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2222em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal">u</span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord mathnormal">x</span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal">t</span><span class="mclose">)</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.686em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mclose nulldelimiter"></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p>空间二阶导数也类似：</p><p class="katex-block"><span class="katex-display"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="block"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant="normal">∂</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>u</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">∂</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>≈</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mi>x</mi><mo separator="true">,</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator="true">,</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mi>x</mi><mo separator="true">,</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\\frac{\\partial^2 u}{\\partial x^2} \\approx \\frac{u(x+\\Delta x,t)-2u(x,t)+u(x-\\Delta x,t)}{\\Delta x^2} </annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:2.1771em;vertical-align:-0.686em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mopen nulldelimiter"></span><span class="mfrac"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:1.4911em;"><span style="top:-2.314em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:3em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord" style="margin-right:0.05556em;">∂</span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal">x</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.7401em;"><span style="top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style="top:-3.23em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:3em;"></span><span class="frac-line" style="border-bottom-width:0.04em;"></span></span><span style="top:-3.677em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:3em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord"><span class="mord" style="margin-right:0.05556em;">∂</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.8141em;"><span style="top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mord mathnormal">u</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.686em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mclose nulldelimiter"></span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">≈</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:2.113em;vertical-align:-0.686em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mopen nulldelimiter"></span><span class="mfrac"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:1.427em;"><span style="top:-2.314em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:3em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord">Δ</span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal">x</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.7401em;"><span style="top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style="top:-3.23em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:3em;"></span><span class="frac-line" style="border-bottom-width:0.04em;"></span></span><span style="top:-3.677em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:3em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal">u</span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord mathnormal">x</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2222em;"></span><span class="mbin">+</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2222em;"></span><span class="mord">Δ</span><span class="mord mathnormal">x</span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal">t</span><span class="mclose">)</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2222em;"></span><span class="mbin">−</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2222em;"></span><span class="mord">2</span><span class="mord mathnormal">u</span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord mathnormal">x</span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal">t</span><span class="mclose">)</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2222em;"></span><span class="mbin">+</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2222em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal">u</span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord mathnormal">x</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2222em;"></span><span class="mbin">−</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2222em;"></span><span class="mord">Δ</span><span class="mord mathnormal">x</span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal">t</span><span class="mclose">)</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.686em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mclose nulldelimiter"></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p>这样 PDE 就变成了一个更新公式：</p><p class="katex-block"><span class="katex-display"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="block"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><msubsup><mi>u</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mi>u</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></msubsup></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>α</mi><mfrac><mrow><msubsup><mi>u</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></msubsup><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><msubsup><mi>u</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>u</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></msubsup></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\\frac{u_i^{n+1}-u_i^n}{\\Delta t} = \\alpha \\frac{u_{i+1}^{n}-2u_i^n+u_{i-1}^{n}}{\\Delta x^2} </annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:2.2172em;vertical-align:-0.686em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mopen nulldelimiter"></span><span class="mfrac"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:1.5312em;"><span style="top:-2.314em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:3em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord">Δ</span><span class="mord mathnormal">t</span></span></span><span style="top:-3.23em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:3em;"></span><span class="frac-line" style="border-bottom-width:0.04em;"></span></span><span style="top:-3.677em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:3em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal">u</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.8542em;"><span style="top:-2.4231em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">i</span></span></span><span style="top:-3.1031em;margin-right:0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">n</span><span class="mbin mtight">+</span><span class="mord mtight">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.2769em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2222em;"></span><span class="mbin">−</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2222em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal">u</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.6644em;"><span style="top:-2.4413em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">i</span></span></span><span style="top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">n</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.2587em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.686em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mclose nulldelimiter"></span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">=</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:2.0574em;vertical-align:-0.686em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right:0.0037em;">α</span><span class="mord"><span class="mopen nulldelimiter"></span><span class="mfrac"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:1.3714em;"><span style="top:-2.314em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:3em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord">Δ</span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal">x</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.7401em;"><span style="top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style="top:-3.23em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:3em;"></span><span class="frac-line" style="border-bottom-width:0.04em;"></span></span><span style="top:-3.707em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:3em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal">u</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.6644em;"><span style="top:-2.4413em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">i</span><span class="mbin mtight">+</span><span class="mord mtight">1</span></span></span></span><span style="top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.317em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2222em;"></span><span class="mbin">−</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2222em;"></span><span class="mord">2</span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal">u</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.6644em;"><span style="top:-2.4413em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">i</span></span></span><span style="top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">n</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.2587em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2222em;"></span><span class="mbin">+</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2222em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal">u</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.6644em;"><span style="top:-2.4413em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">i</span><span class="mbin mtight">−</span><span class="mord mtight">1</span></span></span></span><span style="top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.317em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.686em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mclose nulldelimiter"></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p>整理一下：</p><p class="katex-block"><span class="katex-display"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="block"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>u</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mi>u</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></msubsup><mo>+</mo><mi>α</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi><mfrac><mrow><msubsup><mi>u</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></msubsup><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><msubsup><mi>u</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>u</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></msubsup></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">u_i^{n+1} = u_i^n + \\alpha \\Delta t \\frac{u_{i+1}^{n}-2u_i^n+u_{i-1}^{n}}{\\Delta x^2} </annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:1.1311em;vertical-align:-0.267em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal">u</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.8641em;"><span style="top:-2.433em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">i</span></span></span><span style="top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">n</span><span class="mbin mtight">+</span><span class="mord mtight">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.267em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">=</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.9614em;vertical-align:-0.247em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal">u</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.7144em;"><span style="top:-2.453em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">i</span></span></span><span style="top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">n</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.247em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2222em;"></span><span class="mbin">+</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2222em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:2.0574em;vertical-align:-0.686em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right:0.0037em;">α</span><span class="mord">Δ</span><span class="mord mathnormal">t</span><span class="mord"><span class="mopen nulldelimiter"></span><span class="mfrac"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:1.3714em;"><span style="top:-2.314em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:3em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord">Δ</span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal">x</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.7401em;"><span style="top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style="top:-3.23em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:3em;"></span><span class="frac-line" style="border-bottom-width:0.04em;"></span></span><span style="top:-3.707em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:3em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal">u</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.6644em;"><span style="top:-2.4413em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">i</span><span class="mbin mtight">+</span><span class="mord mtight">1</span></span></span></span><span style="top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.317em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2222em;"></span><span class="mbin">−</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2222em;"></span><span class="mord">2</span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal">u</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.6644em;"><span style="top:-2.4413em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">i</span></span></span><span style="top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">n</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.2587em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2222em;"></span><span class="mbin">+</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2222em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal">u</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.6644em;"><span style="top:-2.4413em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">i</span><span class="mbin mtight">−</span><span class="mord mtight">1</span></span></span></span><span style="top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.317em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.686em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mclose nulldelimiter"></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p>这句话非常关键。</p><p>它的意思是：</p><blockquote><p>下一时刻某个点的温度，可以由当前时刻它自己和左右邻居的温度算出来。</p></blockquote><p>这就很适合计算机了。</p><hr><h2 id="_8-计算机实际在做什么" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#_8-计算机实际在做什么"><span>8. 计算机实际在做什么？</span></a></h2><p>假设金属棒切成很多格点：</p><div class="language-text line-numbers-mode" data-highlighter="shiki" data-ext="text" style="--shiki-light:#383A42;--shiki-dark:#abb2bf;--shiki-light-bg:#FAFAFA;--shiki-dark-bg:#282c34;"><pre class="shiki shiki-themes one-light one-dark-pro vp-code"><code class="language-text"><span class="line"><span>x0   x1   x2   x3   x4   x5</span></span>\n<span class="line"><span>|----|----|----|----|----|</span></span></code></pre><div class="line-numbers" aria-hidden="true" style="counter-reset:line-number 0;"><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div></div></div><p>每个点存一个温度：</p><div class="language-text line-numbers-mode" data-highlighter="shiki" data-ext="text" style="--shiki-light:#383A42;--shiki-dark:#abb2bf;--shiki-light-bg:#FAFAFA;--shiki-dark-bg:#282c34;"><pre class="shiki shiki-themes one-light one-dark-pro vp-code"><code class="language-text"><span class="line"><span>u0   u1   u2   u3   u4   u5</span></span></code></pre><div class="line-numbers" aria-hidden="true" style="counter-reset:line-number 0;"><div class="line-number"></div></div></div><p>然后每一步做：</p><div class="language-text line-numbers-mode" data-highlighter="shiki" data-ext="text" style="--shiki-light:#383A42;--shiki-dark:#abb2bf;--shiki-light-bg:#FAFAFA;--shiki-dark-bg:#282c34;"><pre class="shiki shiki-themes one-light one-dark-pro vp-code"><code class="language-text"><span class="line"><span>新的 ui = 旧的 ui + 系数 × (右边温度 - 2×自己温度 + 左边温度)</span></span></code></pre><div class="line-numbers" aria-hidden="true" style="counter-reset:line-number 0;"><div class="line-number"></div></div></div><p>用伪代码写就是：</p><div class="language-text line-numbers-mode" data-highlighter="shiki" data-ext="text" style="--shiki-light:#383A42;--shiki-dark:#abb2bf;--shiki-light-bg:#FAFAFA;--shiki-dark-bg:#282c34;"><pre class="shiki shiki-themes one-light one-dark-pro vp-code"><code class="language-text"><span class="line"><span>for 每个时间步:</span></span>\n<span class="line"><span>    for 每个空间点:</span></span>\n<span class="line"><span>        计算下一时刻的温度</span></span>\n<span class="line"><span>    更新整根金属棒的温度</span></span></code></pre><div class="line-numbers" aria-hidden="true" style="counter-reset:line-number 0;"><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div></div></div><p>这就是 PDE solver 的底层逻辑。</p><p>它并没有“理解热是什么”。<br> 它只是机械地执行大量加减乘除。</p><p>但因为这些加减乘除来自物理方程，所以结果就能模拟物理过程。</p><hr><h2 id="_9-为什么近似是合理的" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#_9-为什么近似是合理的"><span>9. 为什么近似是合理的？</span></a></h2><p>因为导数本身就是从差分来的。</p><p>导数定义为：</p><p class="katex-block"><span class="katex-display"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="block"><semantics><mrow><munder><mrow><mi>lim</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>→</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\\lim_{\\Delta x\\to 0} \\frac{u(x+\\Delta x)-u(x)}{\\Delta x} </annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:2.1713em;vertical-align:-0.7443em;"></span><span class="mop op-limits"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.6944em;"><span style="top:-2.3557em;margin-left:0em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:3em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight"><span class="mord mtight">Δ</span><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">x</span><span class="mrel mtight">→</span><span class="mord mtight">0</span></span></span></span><span style="top:-3em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:3em;"></span><span><span class="mop">lim</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.7443em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mopen nulldelimiter"></span><span class="mfrac"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:1.427em;"><span style="top:-2.314em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:3em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord">Δ</span><span class="mord mathnormal">x</span></span></span><span style="top:-3.23em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:3em;"></span><span class="frac-line" style="border-bottom-width:0.04em;"></span></span><span style="top:-3.677em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:3em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal">u</span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord mathnormal">x</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2222em;"></span><span class="mbin">+</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2222em;"></span><span class="mord">Δ</span><span class="mord mathnormal">x</span><span class="mclose">)</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2222em;"></span><span class="mbin">−</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2222em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal">u</span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord mathnormal">x</span><span class="mclose">)</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.686em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mclose nulldelimiter"></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p>数值方法做的是：</p><blockquote><p>不让 (\\Delta x) 真正变成 0，而是取一个足够小的值。</p></blockquote><p>当网格越来越细：</p><p class="katex-block"><span class="katex-display"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="block"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>→</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator="true">,</mo><mspace width="1em"></mspace><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>→</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\\Delta x \\to 0,\\quad \\Delta t \\to 0 </annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.6833em;"></span><span class="mord">Δ</span><span class="mord mathnormal">x</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">→</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;"></span><span class="mord">0</span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:1em;"></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord">Δ</span><span class="mord mathnormal">t</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">→</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.6444em;"></span><span class="mord">0</span></span></span></span></span></p><p>数值结果通常会越来越接近真实解。</p><p>这叫<strong>收敛性</strong>。</p><p>但注意，不是所有近似都会收敛。<br> 一个 PDE solver 要靠谱，至少要考虑：</p><ul><li>一致性：离散公式确实近似原 PDE</li><li>稳定性：误差不会随着计算爆炸</li><li>收敛性：网格变细时结果趋近真实解</li></ul><hr><h2 id="_10-为什么不能把网格无限细" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#_10-为什么不能把网格无限细"><span>10. 为什么不能把网格无限细？</span></a></h2><p>因为计算资源有限。</p><p>假设一维空间有 1000 个点，时间走 1000 步，大概有：</p><p class="katex-block"><span class="katex-display"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="block"><semantics><mrow><mn>1000</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>1000</mn><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>6</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">1000 \\times 1000 = 10^6 </annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;"></span><span class="mord">1000</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2222em;"></span><span class="mbin">×</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2222em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.6444em;"></span><span class="mord">1000</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">=</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.8641em;"></span><span class="mord">1</span><span class="mord"><span class="mord">0</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.8641em;"><span style="top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight">6</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p>次规模的计算。</p><p>如果是三维空间，每个方向 1000 个点：</p><p class="katex-block"><span class="katex-display"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="block"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>1000</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>9</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">1000^3 = 10^9 </annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.8641em;"></span><span class="mord">100</span><span class="mord"><span class="mord">0</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.8641em;"><span style="top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">=</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.8641em;"></span><span class="mord">1</span><span class="mord"><span class="mord">0</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.8641em;"><span style="top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight">9</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p>这还只是一个时间层。<br> 如果再走 1000 个时间步：</p><p class="katex-block"><span class="katex-display"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="block"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>9</mn></msup><mo>×</mo><mn>1000</mn><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>12</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">10^9 \\times 1000 = 10^{12} </annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.9474em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;"></span><span class="mord">1</span><span class="mord"><span class="mord">0</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.8641em;"><span style="top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight">9</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2222em;"></span><span class="mbin">×</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2222em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.6444em;"></span><span class="mord">1000</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">=</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.8641em;"></span><span class="mord">1</span><span class="mord"><span class="mord">0</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.8641em;"><span style="top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight"><span class="mord mtight">12</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p>计算量会非常大。</p><p>所以数值模拟永远在做权衡：</p><blockquote><p>网格越细，结果越准，但计算越贵。<br> 网格越粗，计算越快，但误差越大。</p></blockquote><hr><h2 id="_11-为什么这叫-模拟-而不是-精确求解" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#_11-为什么这叫-模拟-而不是-精确求解"><span>11. 为什么这叫“模拟”，而不是“精确求解”？</span></a></h2><p>因为它给出的不是连续函数的完美公式，而是一堆离散点上的近似值。</p><p>比如真实解是：</p><p class="katex-block"><span class="katex-display"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="block"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator="true">,</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">u(x,t) </annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal">u</span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord mathnormal">x</span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal">t</span><span class="mclose">)</span></span></span></span></span></p><p>而计算机得到的是表格：</p><div class="language-text line-numbers-mode" data-highlighter="shiki" data-ext="text" style="--shiki-light:#383A42;--shiki-dark:#abb2bf;--shiki-light-bg:#FAFAFA;--shiki-dark-bg:#282c34;"><pre class="shiki shiki-themes one-light one-dark-pro vp-code"><code class="language-text"><span class="line"><span>t=0.00:  u0, u1, u2, u3, ...</span></span>\n<span class="line"><span>t=0.01:  u0, u1, u2, u3, ...</span></span>\n<span class="line"><span>t=0.02:  u0, u1, u2, u3, ...</span></span></code></pre><div class="line-numbers" aria-hidden="true" style="counter-reset:line-number 0;"><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div></div></div><p>这些值可以画成曲线、动画、温度图、流场图。</p><p>所以 PDE solver 的输出常常不是一个公式，而是：</p><ul><li>数值数组</li><li>网格数据</li><li>可视化图像</li><li>动画</li><li>统计量，比如最大温度、总流量、压力分布</li></ul><hr><h2 id="_12-一个更底层的理解-pde-solver-是-状态推进器" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#_12-一个更底层的理解-pde-solver-是-状态推进器"><span>12. 一个更底层的理解：PDE solver 是“状态推进器”</span></a></h2><p>很多 PDE 都可以理解成：</p><p class="katex-block"><span class="katex-display"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="block"><semantics><mrow><mtext>当前状态</mtext><mo>⇒</mo><mtext>下一状态</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">当前状态 \\Rightarrow 下一状态 </annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.6833em;"></span><span class="mord cjk_fallback">当前状态</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">⇒</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.6833em;"></span><span class="mord cjk_fallback">下一状态</span></span></span></span></span></p><p>比如：</p><ul><li>当前温度分布 → 下一刻温度分布</li><li>当前水流速度和压力 → 下一刻速度和压力</li><li>当前电磁场 → 下一刻电磁场</li><li>当前应力状态 → 下一刻变形状态</li></ul><p>数值求解器的本质就是：</p><div class="language-text line-numbers-mode" data-highlighter="shiki" data-ext="text" style="--shiki-light:#383A42;--shiki-dark:#abb2bf;--shiki-light-bg:#FAFAFA;--shiki-dark-bg:#282c34;"><pre class="shiki shiki-themes one-light one-dark-pro vp-code"><code class="language-text"><span class="line"><span>给定初始状态</span></span>\n<span class="line"><span>重复应用更新规则</span></span>\n<span class="line"><span>得到未来状态</span></span></code></pre><div class="line-numbers" aria-hidden="true" style="counter-reset:line-number 0;"><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div></div></div><p>这和游戏物理引擎很像。</p><p>游戏里角色、布料、烟雾、水面也是每一帧更新一次。<br> 科学计算里的 PDE solver 更严格、更物理、更重视误差和稳定性。</p><hr><h2 id="_13-关键矛盾总结" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#_13-关键矛盾总结"><span>13. 关键矛盾总结</span></a></h2><p>PDE 的世界：</p><div class="language-text line-numbers-mode" data-highlighter="shiki" data-ext="text" style="--shiki-light:#383A42;--shiki-dark:#abb2bf;--shiki-light-bg:#FAFAFA;--shiki-dark-bg:#282c34;"><pre class="shiki shiki-themes one-light one-dark-pro vp-code"><code class="language-text"><span class="line"><span>连续空间</span></span>\n<span class="line"><span>连续时间</span></span>\n<span class="line"><span>无限多点</span></span>\n<span class="line"><span>导数和极限</span></span>\n<span class="line"><span>想求函数</span></span></code></pre><div class="line-numbers" aria-hidden="true" style="counter-reset:line-number 0;"><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div></div></div><p>计算机的世界：</p><div class="language-text line-numbers-mode" data-highlighter="shiki" data-ext="text" style="--shiki-light:#383A42;--shiki-dark:#abb2bf;--shiki-light-bg:#FAFAFA;--shiki-dark-bg:#282c34;"><pre class="shiki shiki-themes one-light one-dark-pro vp-code"><code class="language-text"><span class="line"><span>离散内存</span></span>\n<span class="line"><span>有限数字</span></span>\n<span class="line"><span>有限精度</span></span>\n<span class="line"><span>循环和数组</span></span>\n<span class="line"><span>加减乘除</span></span></code></pre><div class="line-numbers" aria-hidden="true" style="counter-reset:line-number 0;"><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div></div></div><p>PDE solver 做的事就是把前者翻译成后者：</p><div class="language-text line-numbers-mode" data-highlighter="shiki" data-ext="text" style="--shiki-light:#383A42;--shiki-dark:#abb2bf;--shiki-light-bg:#FAFAFA;--shiki-dark-bg:#282c34;"><pre class="shiki shiki-themes one-light one-dark-pro vp-code"><code class="language-text"><span class="line"><span>连续函数 → 网格上的数组</span></span>\n<span class="line"><span>导数 → 差分/单元积分/矩阵</span></span>\n<span class="line"><span>微分方程 → 代数方程</span></span>\n<span class="line"><span>连续演化 → 时间步进</span></span>\n<span class="line"><span>精确解 → 近似解</span></span></code></pre><div class="line-numbers" aria-hidden="true" style="counter-reset:line-number 0;"><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div></div></div><hr><p>一句话说到底：</p><blockquote><p>我们近似 PDE，不是因为数学上一定不能直接解，而是因为真实 PDE 通常太复杂、连续未知量太多、边界太复杂，而计算机只能处理有限离散数据。<br> 数值模拟把连续问题拆成大量简单计算，而这正是计算机最擅长的事情。</p></blockquote>',196)]))}]]),m=JSON.parse('{"path":"/posts/%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97%E6%9C%BA%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80/%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97%E6%9C%BA%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86%E5%BE%AE%E5%88%86%E6%96%B9%E7%A8%8B%E5%92%8C%E6%95%B0%E5%80%BC%E6%A8%A1%E6%8B%9F.html","title":"计算机处理微分方程和数值模拟","lang":"zh-CN","frontmatter":{"date":"2026-07-15T00:00:00.000Z","tag":["AI_GEN"],"description":"计算机处理微分方程和数值模拟 什么是pde solver PDE solver 就是“偏微分方程求解器”。 PDE = Partial Differential Equation，偏微分方程。它描述的是某个量在空间和时间上如何变化，比如温度、速度、压力、电场、水流高度等。 所以 PDE solver 可以理解成： 用数值方法在计算机上近似求解偏微分方程...","head":[["script",{"type":"application/ld+json"},"{\\"@context\\":\\"https://schema.org\\",\\"@type\\":\\"Article\\",\\"headline\\":\\"计算机处理微分方程和数值模拟\\",\\"image\\":[\\"\\"],\\"datePublished\\":\\"2026-07-15T00:00:00.000Z\\",\\"dateModified\\":\\"2026-07-15T04:08:47.000Z\\",\\"author\\":[{\\"@type\\":\\"Person\\",\\"name\\":\\"Runner2011\\",\\"url\\":\\"https://runner2011.github.io\\"}]}"],["meta",{"property":"og:url","content":"https://runner2011.github.io/posts/%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97%E6%9C%BA%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80/%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97%E6%9C%BA%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86%E5%BE%AE%E5%88%86%E6%96%B9%E7%A8%8B%E5%92%8C%E6%95%B0%E5%80%BC%E6%A8%A1%E6%8B%9F.html"}],["meta",{"property":"og:site_name","content":"Runner2011 blog"}],["meta",{"property":"og:title","content":"计算机处理微分方程和数值模拟"}],["meta",{"property":"og:description","content":"计算机处理微分方程和数值模拟 什么是pde solver PDE solver 就是“偏微分方程求解器”。 PDE = Partial Differential Equation，偏微分方程。它描述的是某个量在空间和时间上如何变化，比如温度、速度、压力、电场、水流高度等。 所以 PDE solver 可以理解成： 用数值方法在计算机上近似求解偏微分方程..."}],["meta",{"property":"og:type","content":"article"}],["meta",{"property":"og:locale","content":"zh-CN"}],["meta",{"property":"og:updated_time","content":"2026-07-15T04:08:47.000Z"}],["meta",{"property":"article:tag","content":"AI_GEN"}],["meta",{"property":"article:published_time","content":"2026-07-15T00:00:00.000Z"}],["meta",{"property":"article:modified_time","content":"2026-07-15T04:08:47.000Z"}]]},"git":{"createdTime":1784088230000,"updatedTime":1784088527000,"contributors":[{"name":"runner2011","username":"runner2011","email":"chenjfsea@gmail.com","commits":2,"url":"https://github.com/runner2011"}]},"readingTime":{"minutes":10.24,"words":3073},"filePathRelative":"posts/计算机基础/计算机处理微分方程和数值模拟.md","excerpt":"\\n<h2>什么是pde solver</h2>\\n<p><strong>PDE solver</strong> 就是“偏微分方程求解器”。</p>\\n<p>PDE = <strong>Partial Differential Equation，偏微分方程</strong>。它描述的是某个量在<strong>空间和时间上如何变化</strong>，比如温度、速度、压力、电场、水流高度等。</p>\\n<p>所以 <strong>PDE solver</strong> 可以理解成：</p>\\n<blockquote>\\n<p>用数值方法在计算机上近似求解偏微分方程的程序/算法。</p>\\n</blockquote>","autoDesc":true}')}}]);